== CANON-14, CANON-19 (change std-strings): Substr past the last character
== stops the program with fault 15; positions count characters, so a
== range that fits in bytes but not in characters traps too.
Use Std.StrUtils

Main :
    S := "héllo"
    PutLn("before")
    PutLn(Substr(S, 4, 3))
    PutLn("not reached")
;
